      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a formal press event at the U.S. House of Representatives, featuring several women, including a prominent speaker at a podium with American and House flags. The text overlay reads 'the future of the democratic party.' The scene is presented as a serious political moment. There is no visible toxicity, abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda intent in the visual or textual elements. The meme appears to be a neutral or positive representation of Democratic leadership, likely intended to convey a message of unity, progress, or institutional strength within the party. The intent is to frame the Democratic Party’s future as being led by these women, possibly to highlight diversity or generational change in leadership. No harmful stereotypes or derogatory metaphors are present.",
